From 54099e6035f1d46fdafe3719efc83e4c1f5d6924 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: claude <noreply@anthropic.com>
Date: Fri, 20 Nov 2026 00:48:16 -0300
Subject: [PATCH 2/4] sched/fair: EEVDF pick path (mainline v6.6 level)

Augmented rbtree with min_deadline, pick_eevdf, entity_eligible,
place_entity with PLACE_LAG, update_deadline, yield deadline push,
EEVDF wakeup preemption. Removes CFS sleeper/granularity placement and
vruntime normalisation. Android hooks kept; check_preempt_tick hooks no
longer fire.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
Claude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01DREwy12p2CD14uT4q9ENmB
